      "evidence": "app.get('/products', ...)",
      "llm_reasoning": "The /products endpoint is vulnerable to brute-force or resource exhaustion attacks as it lacks rate limiting.",
      "suggested_fix": "Implement express-rate-limit middleware to restrict the number of requests per IP."
